# Opcodes this fixture acknowledges as not-yet-legalised. Each later
# 7-stage should be able to delete entries from this file as it ships.
#
# push / pop  — function prologue/epilogue save+restore of EBP.
#               Legalised by stage 7d alongside CALL/RET when the
#               return-address machinery is rewritten.
# sub         — `sub esp, N` in the prologue. Stage 7d's prologue
#               rewrite will replace it with a mov sequence (or remove
#               the explicit reserve once the frame is mov-only).
# ret         — function return. Stage 7d.
push
pop
sub
ret
